<title>MEXICO: Televisa swings to 6-month net profit.</title>
<headline>Televisa swings to 6-month net profit.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>6-mo 1997		     6-mo 1996</p>
<p>     Shr			   n/a			n/a</p>
<p>     Net		    4.69 bln	     786.55 million loss</p>
<p>     Revs		   6.07 bln		 5.43 bln</p>
<p>     Gross profit	 2.14 bln		 1.86 bln</p>
<p>     Oper profit	496.98 million	     149.33 million</p>
<p>     Integ fin cost   167.89 million     cost  318.24 million</p>
<p>	    NOTE: All figures in Mexican pesos.</p>
<p>	    Full company name is Grupo Televisa SA.</p>
<p>((--Caroline Brothers, Mexico City newsroom, +525 728-7902))</p>
